{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06529","headline":"夜到洛口入黄河 · 储光羲","name":"夜到洛口入黄河","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河洲多青草，朝暮增客愁。\n客愁惜朝暮，枉渚蹔停舟。\n中宵大川静，解缆逐归流。\n浦漵既清旷，沿洄非阻修。\n登舻望落月，击汰悲新秋。\n倘遇乘槎客，永言星汉游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06529.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06529","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}